      "languageNotes": "Held-C control set (Pause/Back/Finish) kept honestly disabled until the backend wires them, per the no-fake-UI rule."
    },
    {
      "id": "file:CornerCV6.jsx",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "CornerCV6.jsx",
      "filePath": "CornerCV6.jsx",
      "summary": "Root entry component for the CV6 dashboard surface that /dashboard now renders; mounts every screen (Home, Chat, Support, Command, Tracker, LiveScribe, Search) as a fill-in template fed real data, with a view-machine router and demo fixtures.",
      "tags": ["entry-point", "root-component", "router", "dashboard", "screen-composition"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Screens are composed by filling Claude Design HTML templates (imported ?raw) through TemplateScreen rather than hand-drawn JSX; CV4 stays reachable at ?cv4=1 as a fallback."
    },
    {
